#: title/pc5_web_page.html:142
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Steam app ID, e.g. 1091500"
msgstr "معرف تطبيق Steam، مثل 1091500"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:145 title/pc5_web_page.html:171
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "حفظ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:148 title/pc5_web_page.html:174
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:260
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "جار الحفظ…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:152
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr "حفظ: يجلب الغلاف والخلفية والتفاصيل مجددا عند فتح PC5."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "مسح: يعيد PC5 قراءة مجلد اللعبة."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:155 title/pc5_web_page.html:180
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:268
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "لم يحفظ: ⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:158
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "؛ منتج GOG ‏⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:159
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"يختار PC5 غلاف اللعبة وخلفيتها وتفاصيلها بهذا الرقم (⁨%s⁩⁨%s⁩). إذا كانت "
"للعبة أخرى، أدخل الرقم من رابط اللعبة في متجر Steam "
"‏(store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). تركه فارغا يعيد قراءة المجلد."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:178
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "حفظ: يستخدم عند تشغيل اللعبة لاحقا."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Files: change a game's text files"
msgstr "الملفات: تعديل ملفات اللعبة النصية"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Game folder"
msgstr "مجلد اللعبة"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Windows (registry, saves, settings)"
msgstr "Windows (السجل وبيانات الحفظ والإعدادات)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:224
msgctxt "web"
msgid "This folder is empty"
msgstr "هذا المجلد فارغ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:235
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Larger than 8 MB: too large to change here"
msgstr "أكبر من 8 MB: حجمه كبير جدا للتعديل هنا"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "لم يعرض: ⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8 مع علامته"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "غربي (بايت لكل حرف)"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr ""
"⁨%s⁩ · نهايات الأسطر ⁨%s⁩ · %d أسطر · ⁨%s⁩. يحفظ كما كان بالترميز ونهايات "
"الأسطر نفسها. تقرؤه اللعبة عند تشغيلها لاحقا."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "إغلاق"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "حفظ."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "الإغلاق دون حفظ التغييرات؟"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr "يكتب Wine ملفات .reg أثناء اللعب: عدلها فقط عندما لا تعمل أي لعبة."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:280
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "لم يفتح: ⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"ملفات نصية فقط مثل .ini و.cfg و.txt و.json و.reg، حتى 8 MB. يمكن تعديلها "
"أيضا من مدير الملفات على الجهاز سطرا بسطر."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "لا توجد ألعاب بعد."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "وحدة USB"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "تعذر التشغيل"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "الإعدادات: ⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "أحدث سجل"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "الإبلاغ عن مشكلة"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr "ينزل أحدث سجل ويفتح نموذج GitHub مع البيانات: أرفق السجل هناك."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "خيارات التشغيل (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:316
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr "يضاف أول سطر غير فارغ وليس تعليقا (# أو ;) إلى سطر أوامر البرنامج."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "متغيرات البيئة (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "NAME=value واحد في كل سطر، يضبط قبل بدء اللعبة."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "سجلات إضافية (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:322
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"فقط إذا طلب البلاغ ذلك، مثل err+all,+seh. أفرغه بعد ذلك: يبطئ اللعبة."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "لم تحمل الألعاب: ⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:340
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "لا توجد سجلات محفوظة."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:344
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "واجهت مشكلة"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:347
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "لم تحمل السجلات: ⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:356
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "انقطع الاتصال"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:373
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sending %d of %d: %s"
msgstr "إرسال %d من %d: ‏⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:377
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Stopped at %s: %s"
msgstr "توقف عند ⁨%s⁩: ‏⁨%s⁩"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:384
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sent %d files (%s). PC5 asks to install the game in a moment."
msgstr "أرسل %d ملفا (⁨%s⁩). سيطلب PC5 تثبيت اللعبة بعد قليل."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:393
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Type the game's folder name first (no / or \\)."
msgstr "اكتب اسم مجلد اللعبة أولا (دون / أو \\)."

#~ msgid "Maximum: all of it, for a game that says there is too little."
#~ msgstr "الحد الأقصى: الذاكرة كلها، للعبة تقول إنها غير كافية."
